e more key islands in southern Red Sea, tighten grip on shipping routes", "url": "https://www.greaterkashmir.com/world/yemens-houthi-rebels-seize-more-key-islands-in-southern-red-sea-tighten-grip-on-shipping-routes-12530796", "summary": "Cairo, Sep 14:Yemen's Houthi rebels captured more strategic islands in the southern Red Sea, Yemeni government and Houthi officials said on Monday, strengthening their control of a major maritime shipping route.The rebels deployed fighters on the islands of Greater Hanish and Lesser Hanish 160 kilometres north of Bab el-Mandeb Strait, according to two government officials and a Houthi official.The Houthis took over the islands after hundreds of government-allied forces withdrew from the archipelago, said the officials who spoke on condition of anonymity because they were not authorised to talk to journalists.The capture of the islands came after the rebels last week seized the port city of Mokha and the island of Mayun, located inside Bab el-Mandeb Strait from Saudi-backed Yemeni government forces. (AP)", "published_at": "2026-09-14T08:02:30+00:00", "image_url": "https://img-cdn.publive.online/fit-in/1200x675/greater-kashmir/media/media_files/2026/09/14/iran-backed-houthis-in-yemen-claim-new-attacks-on-saudi-arabia-2026-09-14-07-25-00.png", "source": {"name": "Greater Kashmir", "tier": "independent", "url": "https://www.greaterkashmir.com"}, "bias_scores": [{"political_lean": 50, "sensationalism": 10, "opinion_fact": 25, "factual_rigor": 50, "framing": 16, "confidence": 0.7, "rationale": {"framing": {"connotation_score": 36.5, "keyword_emphasis_score": 0.0, "omission_score": 37.1, "headline_body_divergence": 7.0, "has_cluster_context": true}}}]}}, {"article": {"id": "ad959c53-ae84-4a4a-8c8a-3ae29a4f09c1", "title": "Houthi gains deepen risk as carriers restore Red Sea services", "url": "https://www.freightwaves.com/news/houthi-gains-deepen-risk-as-carriers-restore-red-sea-services", "summary": "Container carriers Red Sea return is lo